On Smartphone for use in Locus Maps, copy profile to Internal Storage/Android/data/menion.android.locus.pro/files/Locus/router/profiles2/
(accessible on Android 13 only FV File Explorer, not by regular file manager on device)
Then in Locus Maps: Settings - Navigation - Router: Routing profile, EXTERNAL PROFILES

on Android 15 copy works only by starting Shizuku, then copy with Solid Explorer
